package soul.alignment.secure-by-alignment.case-study-social-media-as-non-existent-infrastructure.the-stateless-aligned-node

analogy "soul.alignment.secure-by-alignment.case-social-media.stateless-node.analogy-drifted-node" {
    body {
        ```
        Drifted Node:
          Post (aksi) → Ego attach → Butuh validation → Metrics masuk → Ego reinforced → Post lagi
          State: Stateful (ego state persist dan grow — drift accelerating)
    }
}

synthesis "soul.alignment.secure-by-alignment.case-social-media.stateless-node.synthesis-node-aligned-nggak-perlu-rules-untuk-nggak" {
    body {
        Node aligned nggak perlu "rules" untuk nggak riya'. **Riya' secara otomatis nggak bisa jalan** karena tidak ada state container untuk ego dalam single-target architecture.
    }
}
